<title>FRANCE: Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of EU grain export/import commitments as of December 10 in the July-to-June 1996/97 campaign, supplied by member country officials.</p>
<p>On December 12, the EU additionally granted exports of 477,700 tonnes of soft wheat, 76,550 tonnes of barley, 2,000 tonnes of rye, 2,500 tonnes of oats, and 13,400 tonnes of durum wheat.</p>
<p>On December 11 EU trade fims also showed contracts to export 568,000 tonnes of soft wheat to Africa under a special long-term relief scheme.</p>
<p>Figures (000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.</p>
